OL,3,GNEWSALoganair looking at operating
OL,4,Aroutes from Guernsey
OL,5,
OL,6,FLoganair is exploring opportunities to
OL,7,Foperate routes from Guernsey, the
OL,8,Fairline's CEO has said.
OL,10,FLuke Farajallah said he was visiting
OL,11,Fthe island for discussions about future
OL,12,Faviation links, nearly a year on from
OL,13,Fwhen its licence applications to fly
OL,14,Ffrom the island - in the wake of the
OL,15,Fcollapse of Blue Islands - were not
OL,16,Fapproved by Guernsey's authorities.
OL,18,FHe said: "We're not a hostile intruder,
OL,19,Fwe come in peace."
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
