OL,3,GNEWSALoganair looking at operating
OL,4,Aroutes from Guernsey
OL,5,
OL,6,FNico Bezuidenhout, CEO of States-owned
OL,7,Fairline Aurigny, said he thought "the
OL,8,Fjury is out to see what level of
OL,9,Fadditional competition [the market] can
OL,10,Fsustain".
